      "widgets_values": [
        "Image 1 provides the first distinct subject. Image 2 provides the second distinct subject. Preserve their separate faces, body proportions, clothing, colors, and scale. A photorealistic continuous medium-wide shot shows both subjects performing one simple shared action in a clearly described location. Keep both subjects visible, physically grounded, and correctly scaled without duplication or identity merging. Use restrained camera movement, clean synchronized dialogue if requested, natural ambience, specific sound effects, no music unless described, no cuts, and no subtitles.",
