      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Setup and model downloads",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## LTX 2.5 MSR performance\n\n1. Accept the LTX 2.5 license and install the split model components.\n2. Download [Licon MSR V1](https://huggingface.co/LiconStudio/LTX-2.5-Multiple-Subject-Reference) to `ComfyUI/models/loras/LTX-2.5/`.\n3. Select two clean single-identity reference sheets. Public workflow image selectors are intentionally empty.\n4. Describe each image separately at the start of the prompt.\n5. Duplicate one Load Image + MSR Reference Stack pair for each additional reference, up to five.\n6. Queue the workflow only after LTX 2.5 Preflight succeeds.\n\nPerformance uses resident BF16 components, 33-frame full-canvas references, dense attention, and substantially more memory. It prioritizes reference density over speed."
      ],
      "color": "#243447",
      "bgcolor": "#15202b"
    }
